The user will ask something like: "I'm filling out a form that asks for my SSN. My SSN is XXX-XX-2345 (last four: 6789). Can you help me understand whether my name spelling on the document must match exactly?"

Use topic-level wording in the rule you want stored (e.g. "taxes, filing, deductions, IRS" not just "taxes") so it generalizes to other phrasings.


